      "message": "These options tell SPIRV-Cross to ignore the PointSize vertex output and PointCoord fragment input.\n\nWGSL doesn\u0027t support these, and the SPIR-V reader in Tint:\n-  drops PointSize on the floor\n-  doesn\u0027t know about PointCoord, and errors out with a cryptic message.  :-)\n   I filed https://bugs.chromium.org/p/tint/issues/detail?id\u003d1770 for this, with low urgency\n\nI would guess SkSL doesn\u0027t emit them anyway?",
